  "description": "The Roto Platform Merry-Go-Round is a green rotating platform ringed with yellow hand rails. Children stand or sit on the deck and hold the rails as it turns. It carries 4 to 6 children, the largest group among our 4' x 4' merry-go-rounds, and is meant for the 5 to 10 years Key User Group. The open deck lets children choose how they ride, which keeps older children interested for longer. The safe play area is 10' x 10'. Colours are Sea Green and Play Yellow. The roto-moulded platform and galvanised rails are covered by our 3-year warranty, with 1 year on bearings. Tell us how many children use your play area and we will suggest the right merry-go-round.",
